      <description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt=&#34;postcard-2014-20140613_11125787_0552&#34; loading=&#34;lazy&#34; src=&#34;//localhost:1313/wp-content/uploads/2014/06/postcard-2014-20140613_11125787_0552.jpg&#34;&gt; &lt;img alt=&#34;postcard-2014-20140613_11130498_0553&#34; loading=&#34;lazy&#34; src=&#34;//localhost:1313/wp-content/uploads/2014/06/postcard-2014-20140613_11130498_0553.jpg&#34;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;From: F.M. Grimes, To: Elijah H. Chandler&lt;br&gt;
Mailed From: Milton, Illinois on May 24, 1887&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;E.H. Chandler, Agt.&lt;br&gt;
Pearl Depot, Illinois&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Milton Beacon&lt;br&gt;
F.M. Grimes,&lt;br&gt;
Editor &amp;amp; Publisher&lt;br&gt;
Established 1875.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Milton, Ill., 5/24 1887&lt;br&gt;
If an organ comes to the Ex office, do not send it up here, but notify me as it goes to Monteguma. Will come after it ourselves.&lt;br&gt;
Resp. F.M. Grimes&lt;/p&gt;</description>
